      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite(s):</strong> —</p><p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a standard action, the time mage can channel time into a wound, causing it to experience rapid healing, as if many days had passed. The time mage may spend a mote to heal his own wounds, or the wounds of an ally touched. The wounds heal for 1d8 damage + 1 per class level of the time mage. This ability increases by an additional 1d8 every 4 levels to a maximum of 5d8.</p>",
